{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And Moab said to the elders of Midian.</b> For they were their neighbors and their allies, as it is written: ״המכה את מדין בשדה מואב״ — that the Midianites came to help Moab, and Hadad son of Bedad struck them." "<b>Now he will lick up.</b> Now that Sihon had conquered the towns of the kingdom of Moab, from now on he will lick up and make an end of all that remains." "<b>Like the ox licks.</b> With his tongue, for it is like a comb to him, since he has no upper teeth as clean animals do."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:19:12.399891791Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}